@baseUrl = http://localhost:5089/api/tables


### Listar mesas
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Consultar una mesa
GET {{baseUrl}}/Me1

### Cambiar estado (962000000 = Disponible, 962000001 = Ocupada)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Me1
Content-Type: application/json

962000001

### Poner número de personas (>= 1 la marca Ocupada, 0 la deja Disponible)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Me1/people
Content-Type: application/json

3

### Asociar mesas (Me2 y Me3 se unen a Me1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Me1/group
Content-Type: application/json

["Me2", "Me3"]

### Desasociar solo la mesa Me3 del grupo de Me1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Me1/group/Me3
